+     *   - if the TCB is fine and the wedge is the post-`eret` user instruction FETCH (I-side, at
+     *     registers[NextIP]), the touch is fast, stage 13 fires immediately, and the 32.4s falls in
+     *     the 13->9 window -> [STAGECP] prev=13 this=9.
+     * 5 cacheable reads at 64-byte strides cover the ~296-byte (5 line) context. The `ldp` below
