 {
+#if AIOS_ASID_GEN
+    /* Coarser under ASID-gen: there is no per-VA `tlbi`, so abandon the whole asid's hw binding
+     * (the running thread re-walks under a fresh hw). Acceptable cold-TLB cost on the teardown /
