+/* ======================================================================
+ * AIOS A72 IMP-DEF register probe (DIAGNOSTIC -- remove after the stall hunt).
+ *
+ * Reads CPUECTLR_EL1 / CPUACTLR_EL1 / L2CTLR_EL1 / L2ACTLR_EL1 on the boot
+ * core and prints them + the bits relevant to the idle-teardown TLBI/DVM
